WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.120
Let's use slash commands. Slash commands

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.680
are an advanced way to perform actions

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.080
in context of content.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.160
To initiate slash commands, we're going

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.560
to hit edit.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.400
We're going to click on any line or

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.600
we're going to hit enter.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.160
After hitting enter, you should see a

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.160
faded message somewhat like this. In

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.400
this case, it says type slash for quick

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.840
actions.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.560
So, I'm going to hit slash on the

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.840
keyboard and it's going to give me the

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.080
equivalent of this bar at the top, but

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.840
in context.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.480
Right? So, now to do that video player

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.080
from before, I could just type video,

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.600
hit enter, and it inserts it in the

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.440
page.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.000
Slash commands are a powerful way

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.560
to write content rapidly. If I know I

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.040
need a heading and I want a heading

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:57.040
three here,

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:02.280
hit enter,

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.960
insert a bulleted list, and keep working

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.760
from there.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:10.120
You could also do slash commands

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.920
and scroll through to see what all the

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.280
available options are.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:16.120
And all of these commands are also

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.920
available if we select the bar at the

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.760
top.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.200
Just makes it so we don't have to have

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.720
our hands leave the keyboard if we're

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.720
doing a long document and typing.
